    "content": "1.2.1.4【待定系数类型】"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.119,
      0.248,
      0.134
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲适用题型：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.142,
      0.844,
      0.214
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "知道可以配凑出 \\(\\left(\\frac{m}{a} + \\frac{n}{b}\\right)(pa + qb)\\) 结构，但是不能直接观察出系数的不等式题型；如：已知正实数 \\(x\\)、\\(y\\) 满足 \\(\\frac{1}{x + 3y} + \\frac{1}{2x + y} = 1\\)，则 \\(x + y\\) 的最小值为 ____.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.221,
      0.248,
      0.236
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲方法原理：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.242,
      0.649,
      0.259
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "1. 如果可以直接看出或者简单尝试可知系数关系的，则直接处理",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.267,
      0.648,
      0.3
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "比如： \\(x > 0, y > 0, x + 2y = 1\\) ，则 \\(\\frac{1}{4x + 3} + \\frac{1}{2y + 1}\\) 的最小值为",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.31,
      0.667,
      0.43
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "变形： \\(\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}x + 2y = \\frac{1}{4}(4x + 3) + (2y + 1) - \\frac{7}{4} = 1 \\Rightarrow (4x + 3) + 4(2y + 5) = 11 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4x + 3} + \\frac{1}{2y + 5} = \\frac{1}{11}\\left(\\frac{1}{4x + 3} + \\frac{1}{2y + 5}\\right)\\left[(4x + 3) + 4(2y + 5)\\right] \\\\ \\text{此时建议结合换元处理结构更简单}\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}4x + 3 = m \\\\ 2y + 1 = n \\end{array} \\right. \\end{array} \\right.\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.44,
      0.479,
      0.456
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2. 不易看出系数关系的，则待定系数处理：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.465,
      0.657,
      0.497
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "比如： \\(x > 0, y > 0, 3x + y = 1\\) ，则 \\(\\frac{1}{5x + y} + \\frac{1}{5x + 3y}\\) 的最小值为",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.507,
      0.691,
      0.678
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "变形：\\(\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 3x + y = m(5x + y) + n(5x + 3y) \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} 5m + 5n = 3 \\\\ m + 3n = 1 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} m = \\frac{2}{5} \\\\ n = \\frac{1}{5} \\end{cases} \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{5x + y} + \\frac{1}{5x + 3y} = \\left( \\frac{1}{5x + y} + \\frac{1}{5x + 3y} \\right) \\left[ \\frac{2}{5}(5x + y) + \\frac{1}{5}(5x + 3y) \\right] \\\\ \\text{此时建议结合换元处理结构更简单} \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 5x + y = m \\\\ 5x + 3y = n \\end{array} \\right. \\end{array} \\right.\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.69,
      0.85,
      0.723
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "例题1.（全国·高三专题练习）已知正数 \\(x, y\\) 满足 \\(\\frac{2}{x + 3y} + \\frac{1}{3x + y} = 1\\)，则 \\(x + y\\) 的最小值（）",
